        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-yellow-200">
            <div class="placeholder-grid flex min-h-[150px] items-center justify-center border-b border-yellow-100 bg-yellow-100/70 text-center"><div><div class="text-4xl">💰</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-black">PLACEHOLDER SCREENSHOT FINANCE TRACKER</p></div></div>
            <div class="p-5"><b>🎁 Bonus #1 — Finance Tracker</b><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Untuk catat pemasukan, pengeluaran, saldo, dan ringkasan keuangan.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-yellow-200">
            <div class="placeholder-grid flex min-h-[150px] items-center justify-center border-b border-yellow-100 bg-yellow-100/70 text-center"><div><div class="text-4xl">📌</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-black">PLACEHOLDER SCREENSHOT PROJECT TRACKER</p></div></div>
            <div class="p-5"><b>🎁 Bonus #2 — Project Management Tracker</b><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Untuk tracking task, deadline, PIC, prioritas, dan progress.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-yellow-200">
            <div class="placeholder-grid flex min-h-[150px] items-center justify-center border-b border-yellow-100 bg-yellow-100/70 text-center"><div><div class="text-4xl">🧩</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-black">PLACEHOLDER SCREENSHOT KANBAN TRACKER</p></div></div>
            <div class="p-5"><b>🎁 Bonus #3 — Kanban Tracker Excel</b><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Untuk mengatur pekerjaan dari To Do, In Progress, Review, sampai Done.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-950 px-6 py-10 text-white">
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-300">Kata Mereka</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black leading-tight">Kata Mereka</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black leading-tight text-white">Yang tadinya bingung mulai dari mana, akhirnya punya bahan buat ditunjukin.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">Mockup testimoni untuk draft. Saat live, ganti dengan screenshot asli pembeli.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-7 space-y-5">
          {testimonialImages.map((image) => (
            <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-3 shadow-xl shadow-blue-950/40">
              <img src={image.src} alt={image.alt} class="w-full rounded-[1.5rem]" />
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-3xl bg-white/10 p-5 text-center ring-1 ring-white/10">
          <p class="text-lg font-black">Bukan cuma belajar rumus.</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-slate-300">Targetnya: kamu punya project yang bisa dipahami, ditunjukkan, dan diceritakan.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-50 px-6 py-9">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black leading-tight">Beda dari template Excel biasa.</h2>
        <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <p>Banyak template Excel dibuat untuk orang yang sudah kerja.</p>
          <p><b>Paket ini dibuat untuk kamu yang ingin punya bahan latihan dan bukti skill sebelum masuk kerja.</b></p>
          <p>Setiap project disusun by role, jadi kamu bisa pilih yang paling relevan dengan posisi yang kamu incar.</p>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 font-bold text-slate-950">Kamu kerjakan. Kamu pahami. Kamu jadikan portofolio. Lalu kamu ceritakan saat interview.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="px-6 py-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black">Cocok buat kamu yang:</h2>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-xl font-black leading-snug text-slate-900">
          <li class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-4">✅ Lagi cari kerja dan ingin CV lebih kuat</li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-4">✅ Fresh graduate yang belum punya banyak pengalaman</li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-4">✅ Sudah belajar Excel tapi belum punya project</li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-4">✅ Mau apply role admin, finance, data, ops, atau business support</li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 p-4">✅ Mau pindah karir dan butuh bahan portofolio</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="harga" class="bg-blue-700 px-6 py-10 text-center text-white">
        <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-100">Harga paket</p>
        <div class="mt-2 text-5xl font-black">Rp49.000</div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold">Lebih murah dari ongkos kirim lamaran yang terus ditolak.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-3xl bg-blue-900/70 p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-yellow-300">Promo bonus berakhir dalam</p>
          <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-center" aria-label="Countdown promo">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-3 text-blue-900"><div id="days" class="text-2xl font-black">00</div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase">Hari</div></div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-3 text-blue-900"><div id="hours" class="text-2xl font-black">00</div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase">Jam</div></div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-3 text-blue-900"><div id="minutes" class="text-2xl font-black">00</div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase">Menit</div></div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-3 text-blue-900"><div id="seconds" class="text-2xl font-black">00</div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase">Detik</div></div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-blue-100">Timer ini bisa diganti ke tanggal campaign asli saat launch.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-blue-50">Satu kali bayar. Dapat 20 project Excel, dataset, jawaban, pembahasan, panduan portofolio, CV bullet points, plus 3 bonus tracker.</p>
        <a href="#" class="mt-7 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white px-6 py-4 text-lg font-black text-blue-800">AMBIL PAKET — Rp49.000</a>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-50 px-6 py-9">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">FAQ</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          <details class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" open><summary class="cursor-pointer font-black">Ini cocok buat pemula?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Iya. Kamu dapat dataset, file latihan, jawaban, dan pembahasan. Tetap perlu dikerjakan, tapi nggak mulai dari kosong.</p></details>
          <details class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-black">Ini template kerja atau latihan?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Fokusnya latihan + portfolio. Bukan cuma template kosong, tapi project berbasis role yang bisa kamu kerjakan dan ceritakan.</p></details>
          <details class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-black">Bisa dipakai buat CV atau LinkedIn?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Bisa. Di paket ada panduan portfolio dan CV bullet points supaya hasil latihanmu lebih gampang dijelaskan.</p></details>
          <details class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-black">File dikirim dalam bentuk apa?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">File digital: Excel, dataset, PDF panduan, dan dokumen pendukung. Bisa dipakai berkali-kali setelah download.</p></details>
          <details class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-black">Harus pakai Microsoft Excel?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Disarankan Microsoft Excel supaya formula, chart, dan dashboard tampil paling aman. Google Sheets bisa saja berbeda tampilannya.</p></details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="px-6 py-8 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-black leading-tight">Rekruter mungkin nggak tahu seberapa keras kamu belajar.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Tapi mereka bisa melihat hasil yang kamu tunjukkan.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-bold text-blue-700">Mulai bangun bukti skill Excel-mu hari ini.</p>
      </section>

      <footer class="px-6 pb-24 pt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">
        <p class="font-black text-slate-800">Created by TikTok @severussheet</p>
        <p class="mt-1">Excel portfolio pack untuk latihan, portfolio, dan career preparation.</p>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <div class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-50 mx-auto max-w-[460px] border-t border-slate-200 bg-white/95 p-3 backdrop-blur">
      <a href="#harga" class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-red-600 px-5 py-3 text-center font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-red-200">AMBIL PAKET — Rp49.000</a>
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      const TIMER_KEY = "severussheet_bonus_deadline_v1";
      const DAY_MS = 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;
      let deadline = localStorage.getItem(TIMER_KEY);
      if (!deadline || Number(deadline) < Date.now()) {
        deadline = Date.now() + DAY_MS;
        localStorage.setItem(TIMER_KEY, String(deadline));
      }

      function pad(value) { return String(value).padStart(2, "0"); }

      function tick() {
        const remaining = Math.max(0, Number(deadline) - Date.now());
        const days = Math.floor(remaining / DAY_MS);
        const hours = Math.floor((remaining % DAY_MS) / (60 * 60 * 1000));
        const minutes = Math.floor((remaining % (60 * 60 * 1000)) / (60 * 1000));
        const seconds = Math.floor((remaining % (60 * 1000)) / 1000);

        document.getElementById("days").textContent = pad(days);
        document.getElementById("hours").textContent = pad(hours);
        document.getElementById("minutes").textContent = pad(minutes);
        document.getElementById("seconds").textContent = pad(seconds);

        if (remaining <= 0) {
          deadline = Date.now() + DAY_MS;
          localStorage.setItem(TIMER_KEY, String(deadline));
        }
      }

      tick();
      setInterval(tick, 1000);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
